            {
              "id": "b_feedback",
              "kind": "call",
              "target": "feedback",
              "method": "show",
              "arg": "{ text: '很棒！按钮被点亮了 —— 这就是最小交互单元。', tone: 'success' }"
            },
            {
              "id": "b_count",
              "kind": "assign",
              "target": "t.clicks",
              "value": {
                "expr": "t.clicks + 1"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b_ret",
              "kind": "return",
              "result": "{ status: 'answered', correct: true, scoreDelta: q.scoring }"
            },
            {
              "id": "b_comment",
              "kind": "comment",
              "text": "预设「点击即完成」：副作用后直接 return；on start 守卫保证重复调用不重复计分"
